  "source": {
    "source_id": "companion-background:gaussian-compact-product-lsi",
    "anchor": "FIRST S4.E6 omitted GaussianLSI background; pinned SLT GaussianLSI/TensorizedGLSI full488lines; authored compact original-slice dimension-induction sufficient OR",
    "url": "https://arxiv.org/html/2609.06906v1#S4.E6",
    "original_text": "ASTIS-authored compact finite-product Gaussian background independently sealed before proof.\nFor every n>=0 and signed real C2 compactly supported f on Fin n -> Real, let gamma_n be the actual product of n independent centered variance-one scalar Gaussian laws and D_i f(x)=fderiv Real f x(Pi.single i1). The theorem internally produces L1 of f squared, f squared times log(f squared), every coordinate derivative squared and their finite sum, and proves homogeneous Ent_gamma_n(f squared)<=2 integral sum_i(D_i f)^2. Zero mass and dimension0 are included.\nExact scope: Actual Measure.pi centered variance-one scalar Gaussian for every n including0; true function-square/Phi-square/all-partial-square/full-sum energy L1 plus homogeneous entropy<=2 coordinate-square-sum integral. Only n,f,C2,compact support inputs. Default Pi sup norm is not Euclidean gradient energy. No RMS marginal smoothness, L1/domain/LSI certificate or positive dimension/mass premise. Finite Hilbert law/orthonormal gradient Parseval, noncompact cutoff32/33, separate T2/FIRST4.6 and all paper main/work/composition remain open.\ntheorem compact_gaussian_pi_logSobolev\n    (n : ℕ) (f : (Fin n → ℝ) → ℝ)\n    (hf : ContDiff ℝ 2 f) (hs : HasCompactSupport f) :\n    let γ : Measure (Fin n → ℝ) := Measure.pi (fun _ : Fin n => gaussianReal 0 1)\n    let D : Fin n → (Fin n → ℝ) → ℝ := fun i x => fderiv ℝ f x (Pi.single i 1)\n    Integrable (fun x => (f x)^2) γ ∧\n    Integrable (fun x => (f x)^2 * Real.log ((f x)^2)) γ ∧\n    (∀ i, Integrable (fun x => (D i x)^2) γ) ∧\n    Integrable (fun x => ∑ i, (D i x)^2) γ ∧\n    (∫ x, (f x)^2 * Real.log ((f x)^2) ∂γ) -\n      (∫ x, (f x)^2 ∂γ) * Real.log (∫ x, (f x)^2 ∂γ) ≤\n    2 * ∫ x, ∑ i, (D i x)^2 ∂γ\n\nIndependent source contract:\n{\n  \"schema_version\": 1,\n  \"actor\": \"gaussian_domain_preproof_reviewer_29\",\n  \"status\": \"PRIMARY_SOURCE_CONTRACT_AUTHOR_FROZEN_NOT_SELFVALIDATED\",\n  \"target\": \"AutoSamplingTheory.TechnicalLemmas.FunctionalInequalities.GaussianCompactProductLogSobolev.compact_gaussian_pi_logSobolev\",\n  \"exact_signature\": {\n    \"pin\": \"TARGET\",\n    \"bytes\": 678,\n    \"raw_LF_sha256\": \"fc859f057a9242675d2a769fa3b2dbbd7b66764fdbe429f608decf0018511d50\"\n  },\n  \"primary\": {\n    \"edition\": \"arXiv2609.06906v1\",\n    \"full_raw_sha256\": \"ec485cdad5fe140114be35eef93d19398e0cafcf21abb3fff1bdbbf462e5f94d\",\n    \"anchors\": [\n      \"S4.E6 FIRST\",\n      \"S4.SS1.p4.3\"\n    ],\n    \"attribution\": \"Authored sufficient compact product background; not printed paper theorem\"\n  },\n  \"seven_slots\": {\n    \"objects\": \"all finite n, actual signedf\",\n    \"assumptions\": \"C2 ANDcompact; no L1/mass/bound/LSI certificate\",\n    \"space\": \"defaultsupnormPi(Fin n,Real), actual Borel\",\n    \"measure\": \"literal pi centered variance1 Gaussian, probability derived\",\n    \"operators\": \"actual canonical coordinate fderiv/finite-square-sum\",\n    \"conclusion\": \"all trueL1 + homogeneousentropy<=2 energy\",\n    \"scope\": \"compact Pi only, n0/n1/zeros; no full Hilbert/noncompact/T2/FIRST credit\"\n  },\n  \"binder_classification\": [\n    {\n      \"binder\": \"n:Nat\",\n      \"kind\": \"TYPE_OBJECT\",\n      \"expansion\": \"all0,1,finite n\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"binder\": \"f:(Fin n->Real)->Real\",\n      \"kind\": \"OBJECT\",\n      \"expansion\": \"actual signedobserver default Pi topology/Borel\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"binder\": \"hf:ContDiffReal2f\",\n      \"kind\": \"AUTHORED_CLASS_RESTRICTION\",\n      \"expansion\": \"sufficient stronger compact class vs externalW12; genuine diff/continuous partials internally\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"binder\": \"hs:HasCompactSupportf\",\n      \"kind\": \"AUTHORED_CLASS_RESTRICTION\",\n      \"expansion\": \"actual compact support; bounds/domains/slices internal\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"binder\": \"gamma,D lets\",\n      \"kind\": \"DEFINITION\",\n      \"expansion\": \"literal pi GaussianReal0 1 and coordinatefderiv\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"binder\": \"probability/finite/measurability/L1/bounds\",\n      \"kind\": \"DERIVED\",\n      \"expansion\": \"dependency nodes, never public premises\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"binder\": \"extra positivity/normalization/W12/LSI/domaincertificate\",\n      \"kind\": \"EXCESS_IF_ADDED\",\n      \"expansion\": \"not authorized\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"external_hypotheses_retained\": \"Source W12=MemLp2g+allactualpartials; separate genuine Differentiable/continuous partials/Phi(g²)L1. Source scalarW12 also differentiability/continuousfderiv; not moved into public38/40.\",\n  \"zero_and_metric_boundaries\": {\n    \"n0\": \"Actual Diracemptycarrier, constantentropy0, emptyenergy0\",\n    \"n1\": \"Actual scalarvariance1 law/derivative identification\",\n    \"zeros\": \"Real.log0 totalized; continuousPhi; no positive mass\",\n    \"no_RMS\": \"Apply only original scalar/tail slices, never assume sqrtmarginalC2\",\n    \"no_operatornorm\": \"Coordinate sum is not default Pi supnorm operatornorm²; genuine Euclidean/basis Parseval future\"\n  },\n  \"external_pin\": {\n    \"SLT\": \"d0f506f0a695018265dccb33bcb05e2f5ca1c876\",\n    \"actual_file\": \"SLT/GaussianLSI/TensorizedGLSI.lean\",\n    \"license\": \"Apache-2.0 pinned LICENSE\",\n    \"upstream\": \"Lean4.32/Mathlib81a5d257\",\n    \"local\": \"Lean4.33/Mathlibdb584cd6\",\n    \"callable\": false,\n    \"project_evaluation\": false\n  },\n  \"parent_truth\": \"Existing38/39 exact public interfaces + independent VERIFIED provenance only. Historical conditional39 preread preserved; current39 proof913438 receipt pinned without lifecycle-dependent mathematical substitution.\",\n  \"exposure_attestation\": {\n    \"future40_body_Test_blind_read\": false,\n    \"future40_proof_exists_observed\": false,\n    \"compiler_started\": false,\n    \"proof_search\": false,\n    \"canonical_shared_mutations\": false,\n    \"history\": \"Reviewer authored39graph and reviewed39production/Test solely in separate CLOSED static exposition. Current40 source DAG uses primary/external sources/parent sealed interfaces/API semantics, not39 body or future40 code. Reviewer authored prior40preread, not40StatementSeal or distinct future topology validation.\"\n  },\n  \"remaining_open\": [\n    \"actual40 implementation and independent admission\",\n    \"external unbounded finite entropy/scalar W12 proof-port closure\",\n    \"Hilbert law/gradient Parseval\",\n    \"noncompact cutoff32/33\",\n    \"GaussianT2/W2/FIRST4.6\",\n    \"bias/main/work/cost/composition/PURIFIED\"\n  ],\n  \"compiled_edges\": []\n}\n",
